<section class="s s-vu" id="vse-uslugi" aria-labelledby="vu-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="vu-head"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow" data-eyebrow>Все услуги Центра</div><h2 id="vu-h" data-split>Один подрядчик — <em>все санитарные задачи</em></h2></div><p class="vu-lead">Пест-контроль, санитарная обработка, лабораторный контроль и документы к проверке Роспотребнадзора для организаций Москвы и области.</p></div>
    <div class="vu-grid" data-group="cards"><div class="vu-col"><div class="card vu-g"><div class="vu-gt">Пест-контроль<span>4</span></div><a class="vu-i" href="../../"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-ipm-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Пест-контроль для бизнеса</span><span class="vu-d">Постоянное обслуживание по IPM: мониторинг, программа, отчёты</span><span class="vu-p">договор от 3 900 ₽/мес</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><a class="vu-i" href="../../deratizatsiya/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-deratizatsiya-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Дератизация</span><span class="vu-d">Крысы и мыши: три контура защиты, точки контроля, акты</span><span class="vu-p">от 3 500 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><a class="vu-i" href="../../dezinsektsiya/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-dezinsektsiya-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Дезинсекция</span><span class="vu-d">Тараканы, мухи, моль — без остановки работы объекта</span><span class="vu-p">от 3 500 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><a class="vu-i" href="../../deratizatsiya-i-dezinsektsiya/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-kompleks-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Дератизация и дезинсекция</span><span class="vu-d">Комплекс по одному договору и общему графику</span><span class="vu-p">от 4 900 ₽/мес</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="vu-col"><div class="card vu-g"><div class="vu-gt">Санитарная обработка<span>3</span></div><a class="vu-i" href="../../dezinfektsiya/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-dezinfektsiya-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Дезинфекция</span><span class="vu-d">Плановая и внеплановая обработка помещений</span><span class="vu-p">от 3 500 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><div class="vu-i is-cur" aria-current="page"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-avtotransport-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Дезинфекция автотранспорта</span><span class="vu-d">Кузова, рефрижераторы, автобусы: акт на каждую машину</span><span class="vu-p">от 900 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-here">Вы здесь</span></div><a class="vu-i" href="../../ochistka-dezinfektsiya-ventilyatsii/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-ventilyatsiya-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Очистка и дезинфекция вентиляции</span><span class="vu-d">Воздуховоды и кухонные вытяжки, видео до и после</span><span class="vu-p">от 25 000 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a></div><div class="card vu-cta"><b>Нужно несколько услуг?</b><p>Осмотрим объект за один выезд и рассчитаем всё вместе — с общим графиком работ и комплектом документов.</p><a class="btn btn-w btn-sm" href="#zayavka"><span class="btn-t">Рассчитать комплекс</span></a></div></div><div class="vu-col"><div class="card vu-g"><div class="vu-gt">Контроль и документы<span>4</span></div><a class="vu-i" href="../../sanitarnyy-audit/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-sanaudit-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Санитарный аудит (СЭС-аудит)</span><span class="vu-d">По проверочным листам: акт с реестром нарушений</span><span class="vu-p">от 9 000 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><a class="vu-i" href="../../laboratornye-issledovaniya/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/lab-i-ppk.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Лабораторные исследования</span><span class="vu-d">Смывы, воздух, вода, микроклимат по ППК</span><span class="vu-p">от 2 600 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><a class="vu-i" href="../../razrabotka-ppk/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-razrabotka-ppk-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Разработка ППК</span><span class="vu-d">Программа производственного контроля, в том числе по ХАССП</span><span class="vu-p">от 5 900 ₽</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><a class="vu-i" href="../../normativnaya-baza/dokumenty-dlya-rospotrebnadzora/"><span class="vu-ic" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../img/ig-dokumenty-rpn-128.webp" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="vu-b"><span class="vu-t">Документы для Роспотребнадзора</span><span class="vu-d">Перечень к проверке и чек-лист в PDF</span><span class="vu-p">бесплатно</span></span><span class="vu-a" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
